# mountain_hemlock_far: a far hemlock standing out of a treeline across
# the water (BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B5; doc 11.1), drawn for the wide pixel
# (11.2): softer than the fir, its leader nodding over to the left as one
# pixel off the top, still joined to the crown. Shadow side spruce (11) on
# the left, lit side forest (12) on the right. No trunk: its foot stands in
# the treeline. The anchor, 0,0, is its foot, at the middle. 5 wide, 11
# tall.
C 11  L 0,-10 0,0  L -1,-10  L -1,-7 -1,0  L -2,-4  L -2,-3 -2,0
C 12  L 1,-8 1,0  L 2,-5  L 2,-3 2,0
